{"id":"u-ffc31497-a80f-472f-b15b-98149da78438","src":"community","title":"Absolute Batman","author":"Reyes Saúl  F.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Fey4un-absolute-batman","desc":"This Workout isn't mine, this was from Paris Demers's Abslolute Batman PDF, but I took off some volume because it was redundant in my perspective, but I keep mostly the same workout.  \n\nI would advise that put stretching and warming up. \nAnd some Martial Arts Trainng like Boxing, Judo or BJJ, to be more closer to being the ideal Batman. \n\n\nForward Run to Back Pedal 2x8\n1b. Side to Side Run 2x12\n1c. Dead Hangs 2x60s\n \n\nDAY 3\nSKILL REFINEMENT\n1. Warm Up (10 Minutes):\nShadowboxing, agility drills, and dynamic stretches.\n2. Skill Refinement (20 Minutes):\nPractice and polish existing techniques: striking combos, takedowns,\ntransitions, and escapes. \n3. Integrated Practice (30 Minutes):\nSimulate real life scenarios:\nSpar against multiple opponents.\nNavigate obstacles while striking and grappling.\nTransition between striking and grappling. \n4. Cooldown (10 Minutes): \nStretch shoulders, wrists, and hamstrings.\nDeep breathing for recovery.\n\nSide to Side Run 2x12\n2a. Loaded Pancake Stretch 2x8","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":13,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-28T23:17:57.271Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Lower Day","Upper Day","Lower Day","Upper Day"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Jump Rope","sets":[{"sec":60,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Cossack Squat (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":7,"x":2}]}]},{"n":"High Bar Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Step-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7.5,"x":4}],"note":"Per side"},{"n":"Single Arm Farmer Carry","sets":[{"sec":45,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Copenhagen Plank","sets":[{"sec":30,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}]